{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicThermoParameters",
    "description": "Parameters of MOSAIC's aqueous thermodynamics (chem/module_mosaic_therm.F, WRF v4.8.0): the ZSR binary-molality fits (a_zsr, b_zsr, aw_min), the MTEM binary activity-coefficient fits (b_mtem), the non-electrolyte hygroscopicities (kappa_nonelectro) with the species' molecular weights and densities (mw_aer_mac, dens_aer_mac), the electrolyte and ion molar masses and charges with the ion pairing that ions_to_electrolytes and mesa_estimate_eleliquid use (mw_el, mw_ion, z_ion, pair_cation, pair_anion), and the literals the thermodynamics functions use.\n\nEVERY VALUE IS THE BINARY32 ROUNDING THE MODEL ACTUALLY HOLDS. load_mosaic_parameters assigns the tables from default-real literals (`a_zsr(1,je) = 1.30894`, `b_mtem(1,ja,je) = -2.94685`) into real(kind=8) arrays, so each coefficient is the nearest binary32 value widened to double, not the printed decimal; the same holds for the literals inside the functions (55.509, 0.97, 1.e-9, 1.0e-3). The tables are therefore taken from the instrumented model's own arrays (dumps/chem170_mosaic_therm, field th_*; tools/extract_mosaic_thermo_tables.py transcribes them), and each scalar below gives the decimal it was written as and the binary32 value it is.\n\nIndex order is MOSAIC's (load_mosaic_parameters / module_mosaic_init_aerpar): electrolytes 1 nh4so4, 2 lvcite, 3 nh4hso4, 4 nh4msa, 5 nh4no3, 6 nh4cl, 7 na2so4, 8 na3hso4, 9 nahso4, 10 namsa, 11 nano3, 12 nacl, 13 cano3, 14 cacl2, 15 camsa2, 16 h2so4, 17 msa, 18 hno3, 19 hcl, 20 hhso4, 21 caso4, 22 caco3; aerosol species as aer(1:naer) of the chem_opt = 170 build (iso4_a = 1 ... ina_a = 108, ica_a = 109).",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ]
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "el": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 22
    },
    "aer": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 112
    },
    "pc": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 6
    },
    "ion": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 9
    },
    "solv": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 22
    }
  },
